    "outcome_quote": "**Motion CARRIED.**",
    "source_block": "**MOVED BY: HARDER**\n\n**SECONDED: GUIRY**\n> *THAT Council approve the agenda as presented.*\n\n**Motion CARRIED.**\n\n1\n\nMinutes of the Council Meeting - October 6, 2025 5. PRESENTATIONS 5.1 Traffic Master Plan/Active Transportation Plan Phase 2 - Watt Consulting (Approx. 1 hour) Nadine King and Tim Shah presented an overview of the Traffic Master Plan and the Active Transportation Plan Phase 2. 6. PUBLIC PARTICIPATION W. Hobbs, Langford Resident - re: Item 5.1 - The speaker requested that Council prioritize emerging traffic issues such as increased traffic and speed in regard to the Traffic Master Plan and Active Transportation Plan. S. Costello, Langford Resident - re: Item 5.1 - The speaker requested that Council prioritize emerging traffic issues, such as widening roads to ease congestion in regard to the Traffic Master Plan and Active Transportation Plan. 7. CONSENT AGENDA Minutes of the West Shore Parks and Recreation Society Board of Directors Meeting -June 12, 2025 (RECEIVE) Minutes of the Council Meeting - September 15, 2025 (ADOPT) Draft Minutes of the Community Advisory Committee Meeting - September 29, 2025 (RECEIVE)"
